agentlet (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of upstream agent-go (github.com/dksslq/agent-go).
    Nano-sized terminal AI agent: OpenAI-compatible streaming, tool calling
    (exec / image_read / video_read), multimodal input, session persistence,
    raw-mode line editing; pure Go, zero third-party dependencies.

